"section_title":"关张马黄赵传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0078.xhtml","index":61,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-7ad2e8ad36156d73fd75","start":0,"end":32},{"id":"guanzhang-q-p014","section":"chapter-036","block":"b-0746814bfdce95386c0a","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝五﹞《蜀记》曰：“庞德子会，随钟、邓伐蜀；蜀破，尽灭关氏家。”","attribution":"《蜀记》","section_title":"关张马黄赵传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0078.xhtml","index":61,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-7ad2e8ad36156d73fd75","start":0,"end":32},{"id":"lizang-q-1dac388345849d522b2f","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-5f9b8e0248da72ebfeb8","layer":"original","quote":"文帝即王位，乃遣使就德墓，赐谥，策曰：“昔先轸丧元〖7〗，王蠋绝脰〖8〗；陨身徇节，前代美之。惟侯式昭果毅〖9〗，蹈难成名；声溢当时，义高在昔：寡人愍焉，谥曰壮侯","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":206,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":81},{"id":"lizang-q-62d8aaefbdc8fc883318","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-76f360b0363911f34631","layer":"original","quote":"太祖闻而悲之，为之流涕，封其二子为列侯","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":205,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":88,"end":107},{"id":"lizang-q-96c1d73292e41f48fa17","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-5f9b8e0248da72ebfeb8","layer":"original","quote":"又赐子会等四人爵关内侯，邑各百户","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":206,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":83,"end":99},{"id":"lizang-q2-67c3ab4bfa76e3897ca8","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-5f9b8e0248da72ebfeb8","layer":"original","quote":"文帝即王位，乃遣使就德墓，赐谥，策曰：“昔先轸丧元〖7〗，王蠋绝脰〖8〗；陨身徇节，前代美之。惟侯式昭果毅〖9〗，蹈难成名；声溢当时，义高在昔：寡人愍焉，谥曰壮侯。”又赐子会等四人爵关内侯，邑各百户。会，勇烈有父风，官至中卫将军〖10〗，封列侯。﹝四﹞","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":206,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":126},{"id":"shaodi-e-o123a-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-83abd1e3bad8184c111c","layer":"original","quote":"己卯〖19〗，诏曰：“诸葛诞造构逆乱，迫胁忠义。平寇将军、临渭亭侯庞会，骑督、偏将军路蕃〖20〗，各将左右，斩门突出。忠壮勇烈，所宜嘉异。其进会爵乡侯，蕃封亭侯。”","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":528,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":82},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-6209c552405e0ebbdf98","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-6209c552405e0ebbdf98","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：甘露二年（公元 257 ）。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":535,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-4dd98e402a6a8de51491","start":0,"end":20},{"id":"shaodi-q-o117","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-d021e0b00f489a01f208","layer":"original","quote":"二年春二月〖1〗，青龙现温县井中。三月，司空卢毓薨。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":522,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":26},{"id":"shaodi-q-o123","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-83abd1e3bad8184c111c","layer":"original","quote":"己卯〖19〗，诏曰：“诸葛诞造构逆乱，迫胁忠义。平寇将军、临渭亭侯庞会，骑督、偏将军路蕃〖20〗，各将左右，斩门突出。忠壮勇烈，所宜嘉异。其进会爵乡侯，蕃封亭侯。”","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":528,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":82},{"id":"wgc-q0077","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-a20ce9841d0949b327ba","layer":"original","quote":"艾遂至绵竹，大战，斩诸葛瞻。维等闻瞻已破，率其众东入于巴〖3〗。会乃进军至涪，遣胡烈、田续、庞会等追维〖4〗。艾进军向成都；刘禅诣艾降，遣使敕维等令降于会。维至广汉郪县〖5〗，令兵悉放器仗，送节、传于胡烈〖6〗，便从东道诣会降。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":531,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":114},{"id":"wgc-q0472","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-a20ce9841d0949b327ba","layer":"original","quote":"会乃进军至涪，遣胡烈、田续、庞会等追维","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":531,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":32,"end":51}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
